---
// docs/design-spec.md §5.1.3. No-JS: Grid shows and the toggle is hidden.
---
<div class="view-toggle" role="group" aria-label="View">
  <button type="button" class="toggle-btn" data-view="grid" aria-pressed="true">Grid</button>
  <button type="button" class="toggle-btn" data-view="index" aria-pressed="false">Index</button>
</div>

<style>
  .view-toggle {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  html:not(.js) .view-toggle {
    display: none;
  }
  .toggle-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--c-ink-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    padding-block: 4px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .toggle-btn[aria-pressed='true'] {
    color: var(--c-ink);
  }
  .toggle-btn[aria-pressed='true']::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: -6px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--c-ink);
  }
</style>
